<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Criar conta — JFLoader</title>
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
	<link href="/css/output.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 font-sans text-slate-800 antialiased">
	<%- include('header', { user: locals.user }) %>

	<main class="mx-auto flex min-h-[calc(100vh-5rem)] max-w-6xl items-center justify-center px-4 py-8 sm:px-6">
		<div class="grid w-full max-w-5xl overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm md:min-h-[610px] md:grid-cols-2">
			<aside class="relative hidden min-h-72 overflow-hidden bg-slate-900 md:block">
				<img src="/imgs/developer.jpeg" alt="" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-center">
				<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/90 via-slate-900/15 to-slate-900/10"></div>
				<div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-8 text-white lg:p-10">
					<a href="/" class="font-heading text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">JFLoader</a>
					<p class="mt-8 max-w-sm font-heading text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight">Um lugar para guardar os seus ficheiros.</p>
					<p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-slate-200">Crie a sua conta e mantenha documentos, imagens e outros ficheiros organizados.</p>
				</div>
			</aside>

			<section class="flex items-center px-6 py-9 sm:px-10 lg:px-14">
				<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-md">
					<a href="/" class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-blue-700 md:hidden">JFLoader</a>
					<p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700">Comece por aqui</p>
					<h1 class="mt-2 font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950">Criar uma conta</h1>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Preencha os campos para começar a guardar os seus ficheiros.</p>

					<% if (locals.errors && locals.errors.length > 0) { %>
						<div class="mt-5 rounded-lg border border-rose-200 bg-rose-50 p-4 text-sm text-rose-800" role="alert">
							<p class="mb-2 font-semibold">Verifique os seguintes campos:</p>
							<ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-1">
								<% locals.errors.forEach(error => { %><li><%= error.msg %></li><% }) %>
							</ul>
						</div>
					<% } %>

					<form action="/signup" method="POST" class="mt-6 space-y-4">
						<div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
							<div>
								<label for="firstName" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Nome</label>
								<input type="text" id="firstName" name="firstName" autocomplete="given-name" required placeholder="O seu nome"
									class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-900 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-blue-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-100">
							</div>
							<div>
								<label for="lastName" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Apelido</label>
								<input type="text" id="lastName" name="lastName" autocomplete="family-name" required placeholder="O seu apelido"
									class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-900 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-blue-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-100">
							</div>
						</div>
						<div>
							<label for="username" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Nome de utilizador</label>
							<input type="text" id="username" name="username" autocomplete="username" required placeholder="Escolha um nome de utilizador"
								class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-900 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-blue-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-100">
						</div>
						<div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
							<div>
								<label for="password" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Palavra-passe</label>
								<input type="password" id="password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password" required placeholder="Pelo menos 6 caracteres"
									class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-900 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-blue-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-100">
							</div>
							<div>
								<label for="confirmPassword" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Confirmar palavra-passe</label>
								<input type="password" id="confirmPassword" name="confirmPassword" autocomplete="new-password" required placeholder="Repita a palavra-passe"
									class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-900 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-blue-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-100">
							</div>
						</div>
						<button type="submit" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-blue-700">
							Criar conta <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-xs"></i>
						</button>
					</form>

					<p class="mt-6 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-center text-sm text-slate-600">
						Já tem conta?
						<a href="/login" class="font-semibold text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-800">Entrar</a>
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>

	<%- include('footer') %>
</body>

</html>
